  "description": "Num2WordsNet is a port of the Python project **num2words** to the C# programming language.\n\t\t\t\t\t\tThe num2words library converts numerical values into their word-based representations across multiple languages. For instance, the number \"42\" is transformed into \"forty-two\" (or its equivalent in other supported languages). A comprehensive list of supported languages is provided below..",
